SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Pool swim 45 min\, ~1\,200m total: 300m 
 easy warm-up\, 600m con
DESCRIPTION:Pool swim 45 min\, ~1\,200m total: 300m easy warm-up\, 600m con
 tinuous aerobic at 2:30–2:35/100m\, 200m catch-up/fingertip-drag drills\
 , 100m easy cool-down — no interval sets this first session back\; focus
  is feel and re-establishing water confidence after the extended break.\n\
 nReason: Swim fitness has been absent for 4+ weeks and the athlete is in a
  deep fatigue hole\; removing the intensity intervals on the first session
  back reduces injury and overload risk while still rebuilding the aerobic 
 swim base needed for the 5000m Half Oceanman.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
