DESCRIPTION:60 min Z1 spin at 120–135W maximum\, flat route\, cadence foc
 us (85–90 rpm)\, HR cap 130 bpm — treat entirely as a systems-check an
 d legs-flush ride with zero distance ambition\; do not extend regardless o
 f how good the athlete feels.\n\nReason: Given the sustained body battery 
 collapse through late July and the critical swim priority for Half Oceanma
 n\, keeping this ride very conservative protects the Tuesday and Friday sw
 im sessions in week 7 from being compromised by residual fatigue.\n\nAI co
 aching 2026-08-01
