SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — 14–15km @ 6:30–6:45/km easy aerobic\,
  HR cap 145 bpm\, 95–100 
DESCRIPTION:14–15km @ 6:30–6:45/km easy aerobic\, HR cap 145 bpm\, 95
 –100 min — reduce to a comfortable distance that supports both the Tre
 viso 10K taper beginning week 11 and avoids over-stressing legs needed for
  the Thursday race-pace session two days prior.\n\nReason: 18.5km at this 
 stage of recovery is excessive given the chronic sleep deficit\; a shorter
  long run still builds aerobic base for the Treviso 10K and marathon while
  leaving enough recovery capacity for the following week's quality session
 s.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
